  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1204.11 Application Review Charges",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1204.11 Application Review Charges.\n\n(a) A one-time fee of $200 shall be charged to persons proposing a direct connection to the WRBP system, to cover both WRBP review of the connection request and WRBP inspection of the materials and methods of the connection.\n\n(b) A one-time fee of $75 shall be charged to persons submitting a discharge permit request application, to cover the WRBP’s review of the discharge request to ensure that it complies with department rules governing such discharges.\n\n(c) The fees specified in (a) and (b), above, shall not apply to communities, counties, state agencies, or school districts.\n\nSource. #9798-A, eff 10-9-10; ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1200.html"
